<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Cullinan plans rights issue.</title>
<headline>Cullinan plans rights issue.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial holding company Cullinan Holdings Ltd announced on Friday it would hold a rights issue in order to raise additional capital.</p>
<p>It said the last day to register for the issue would be November 8.</p>
<p>The terms of the issue would be announced in due course, it said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
